{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2023-02-09 11:30:00', 'title': 'GLOBALFOUNDRIES AND GM ANNOUNCE LONG-TERM DIRECT SUPPLY AGREEMENT FOR U.S. PRODUCTION OF SEMICONDUCTOR CHIPS', 'text': "MALTA, N.Y. AND DETROIT , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENERAL MOTORS CO. (NYSE: GM) AND GLOBALFOUNDRIES (NASDAQ: GFS) (GF) TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC, LONG-TERM AGREEMENT ESTABLISHING A DEDICATED CAPACITY CORRIDOR EXCLUSIVELY FOR GM'S CHIP SUPPLY."}